{"id":"07015","root":"uni07015_1","name":{"ja":"葉取　星舟","en":"Hatori Seishu"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"葉取　星舟","en":"Hatori Seishu"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2022-03-01","limited":true,"characterId":337,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。旧井河家を率いた長老衆筆頭にして井河家執事。葉取家は代々井河宗家の執事を務める名門の家であった。星舟は井河扇舟とその弟の母、つまりアサギの祖母にあたる。五車において井河家が主導権を握るために暗躍。政府や財界とも結託し、井河一門を対魔忍随一の権門に育て上げた謀略家だが、結果、井河アサギや桃知東洋と激しく対立。井河アサギと争い敗死したとされる。星遁の術“禹歩”の使い手。“禹歩”とは特別なステップを踏む事で星の力を召喚、あるいは利用する、非常に強力で希少な呪術系忍法。アサギの父の代から執事を務め、齢八十を超えるとされるが忍法“禹歩”の力により非常に若々しい容姿をしている。","en":"She is a Taimanin and the former leader of the Igawa family, serving as the chief elder and steward of the Igawa household. The Hatori family has long been a prestigious household that has served as the steward of the Igawa main family. Seishu is the mother of Igawa Senshu and her brother, making her Igawa Asagi's grandmother. She has been secretly manipulating events in Gosha to give the Igawa family control, forming alliances with the government and financial sectors to raise the Igawa clan to the most powerful Taimanin family. However, this has led to intense conflict with Igawa Asagi and Momochi Toyo. She is said to have died in a battle with Igawa Asagi. Seishu is a master of the \"Yuho\" ninja technique, which allows her to summon and utilize the power of the stars by taking special steps. Having served as a steward since Asagi's father's generation, she is estimated to be over 80 years old, but the power of \"Yuho\" has given her a remarkably youthful appearance."},"illustrator":"羽倉ぼう","voiceActor":"よもぎかすみ","forms":[{"id":"uni07015_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1136,2272],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[188,376],"def":[114,228],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["4","1390001"],"evolve":[["evo00010",50],["evo00011",25],["evo00012",25],["evo00023",30],["evo00021",10]]},{"id":"uni07015_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats"